ering emotional strength, offering solace and hope even in the face of profound tragedy. Her presence is a source of moral and emotional grounding for the narrator, and she consistently demonstrates kindness, loyalty, and a serene nature that contrasts with the surrounding turmoil.</div>\n  1502→                    \n  1503→\n  1504→                    \n  1505→                    \n  1506→\n  1507→                    \n  1508→                    <details style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem;\">\n  1509→                        <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem;\">📊 Metadata</summary>\n  1510→                        <div class=\"profile-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n  1511→                            <span>90 mentions</span> •\n  1512→                            <span>First appears: Ch. 2</span> •\n  1513→                            <span class=\"tag low\">low confidence</span>\n  1514→                        </div>\n  1515→                    </details>\n  1516→                </div>\n  1517→                \n  1518→                <div class=\"character-profile character-item\" data-confidence=\"high\">\n  1519→                    <h4>\n  1520→                        Clerval\n  1521→                        \n  1522→                        \n  1523→                        <span class=\"confidence-badge high\" title=\"Confidence: high\">\n  1524→                            ✓\n  1525→                            \n  1526→                        </span>\n  1527→                    </h4>\n  1528→\n  1529→                    \n  1530→\n  1531→                    \n  1532→                    \n  1533→\n  1534→                    \n  1535→\n  1536→                    \n  1537→\n  1538→                    \n  1539→                    \n  1540→\n  1541→                    \n  1542→                    \n  1543→                    <div class=\"profile-body\">Henry Clerval is a deeply compassionate a